# =============================================================================
# .gitattributes · 行尾统一
#
# 为什么需要：Windows 上 core.autocrlf 的默认行为会让每次 checkout 都改动行尾，
# 造成「没改代码也有 diff」。而且 start.bat **必须是 CRLF**，否则 cmd.exe 解析失败
# （LF-only 的 .bat 会让多行粘成一行，表现为窗口一闪而过）。
# =============================================================================

* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF
*.bat  text eol=crlf
*.cmd  text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不要做行尾/编码转换
*.db     binary
*.onnx   binary
*.safetensors binary
*.parquet binary
*.npy    binary
*.webp   binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.png    binary
*.mp4    binary
*.mov    binary
*.docx   binary
